01:09:51.611 --> 01:09:54.933
We need 3 large cars.
Paris-Marbella in one night.


01:09:56.291 --> 01:09:59.852
The first car to explore.
The second carries the load.


01:09:59.892 --> 01:10:01.974
The third car as an escort.


01:10:02.532 --> 01:10:05.046
They stay in contact by phone all night.


01:10:05.972 --> 01:10:08.009
Each car has an exit.


01:10:08.412 --> 01:10:12.212
-Wait, I've never done this before.
- So what's the problem?


01:10:12.212 --> 01:10:13.850
None.


01:10:15.412 --> 01:10:20.407
You focus on the city, I do the prison.
I'll make deals with leaving prisoners.


01:10:21.172 --> 01:10:24.574
Jordi knows a trucker
who delivers to jails.


01:10:25.653 --> 01:10:28.657
We invest half the money. We divide
the rest by 3. You, me and the Gypsy.


01:10:29.294 --> 01:10:30.455
Okay.


01:10:30.653 --> 01:10:34.408
Put a part in my account.
The rest we'll see.


01:10:35.294 --> 01:10:37.535
- What time is it?
- 6. 45.


01:10:39.414 --> 01:10:42.930
Let me tell you something.


01:10:43.455 --> 01:10:45.332
Come out whenever you want!


01:10:49.335 --> 01:10:51.099
- Be careful.
- You too.


01:10:54.255 --> 01:10:56.019
El Djebena Mali.
35-114T.


01:11:00.016 --> 01:11:02.132
- How was the test?
- Car repairs.


01:11:02.176 --> 01:11:04.975
- Do you like mechanics?
- Yes, definitely.


01:11:06.056 --> 01:11:07.296
I'm in rehab.


01:11:08.096 --> 01:11:09.131
Bend over.


01:11:10.136 --> 01:11:11.036
Cough.


01:11:13.136 --> 01:11:16.777
- Sampiero said we could do it again.
- What do you think?


01:11:16.817 --> 01:11:19.855
- It's legal.
-You see?


01:11:21.297 --> 01:11:26.371
- Who did you see after Sampiero?
- The friend who got me the garage.


01:11:26.857 --> 01:11:28.382
Any problems?


01:11:30.618 --> 01:11:35.419
I'll make myself clear. Your
furloughs are mine. Period.


01:11:35.698 --> 01:11:39.373
- Here I am still your "Arab"?
-Yes, you do the dirty work.


01:11:50.619 --> 01:11:54.943
Put your names on the
top right and fold it.


01:11:55.379 --> 01:11:59.976
You have one hour for French.
Then we continue with Economics.


01:12:00.340 --> 01:12:03.298
- Do we write here?
-Yes, directly on the test sheet.


01:12:10.701 --> 01:12:12.499
ECONOMICS


01:12:37.862 --> 01:12:38.818
You!


01:12:38.862 --> 01:12:42.264
I've heard about your mother.

